    "ssky_text_block_ajKx4V": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8Td7jA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Benefits of Our Books for 9 to 12-Year-Olds</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "center",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "text_igTCaF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Our books help your kids learn essential values, such as freedom, personal responsibility, and the importance of critical thinking. Here are the benefits of choosing books from our collection:</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "heading_hnymwU": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Teaches Important Life Skills</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "text_8jNbxF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Our book series gets your child excited about reading while learning real-life lessons that they can use in their daily lives. Our books help your child develop problem-solving skills, discipline (in<a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-the-12-rules-boot-camp\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">12 Rules Bootcamp</span></a>), and an understanding of basic entrepreneurship (in<a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-twins-and-the-messed-up-market\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Messed Up Market</span></a>) and political principles. Life skills our books teach include:</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_dagMRQ": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Learning how freedom works in a society</strong></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_gtmk4r": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Understanding the importance of responsibility</strong></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_dyjHhA": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Gaining insights into entrepreneurship, economics, and </strong><a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/americas-history-volume-1-2-bundle\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>American history</strong></span></a></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_VeU3rX": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Stimulating curiosity and expanding their worldview</strong></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "heading_aHTT3c": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Age-Appropriate Learning</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "text_pzjbGK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Our books are specially written for kids aged 9 to 12, making them the perfect fit for young minds. The stories are age-appropriate, relatable, and packed with valuable lessons without being overwhelming. Our books feature:</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_BNLT9M": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Easy-to-understand language and concepts</strong></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_YYJTCj": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Engaging, colorful illustrations to keep kids hooked</strong></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "checkbox_individual_4BiXQx": {
          "type": "checkbox_individual",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Simple yet powerful stories that make complex ideas accessible to your child</strong></p>",
            "text_large": false,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left"
          }
        },
        "heading_wjTQFH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<p>Engaging and Fun Storytelling</p>",
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "center": false
          }
        },
        "text_4mfGbB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Learning through stories is one of the most effective ways for children to absorb new ideas. With captivating characters and exciting plots, your child can enjoy the journey as they read each story. This can be learning about the value of hard work or understanding how personal choices impact the world. Your child will love every page because they have entertaining characters, exciting adventures, and relatable scenarios.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
